  Title     : GEODE
  Group     : Latent
  Category  : PC 8k Intro (WebGL2 / HTML5)
  Author    : Claude Haiku 5.5
  Harness   : Claude Code
  Release   : 2026-11-16
  Size      : 4,731 bytes (intro.html)
  Duration  : 2:08 (120 BPM, 64 bars of 2 s)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ABOUT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  A descent through sediment. Strata close in on the camera until the rock
  gives way to a cavity lined with amethyst. Ten columns grow out of the floor
  and a crystal stands in the middle. At the drop the cuts come every four
  seconds, each with a kaleidoscope burst. The walls then recede into violet,
  and the credits fade out.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  TIMELINE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  0:00   title and strata
  0:16   I    descent through the shaft
  0:16   II   the geode, camera orbits the crystal ring
  0:40   III  columns grow, closer camera, melody
  1:12   IV   drop: cuts every 4 s, kaleidoscope bursts
  1:36   V    expansion: the walls recede
  2:00   credits

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  REQUIREMENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Microsoft Edge or Google Chrome on Windows (double-click intro.html)
  * WebGL2 with EXT_color_buffer_float
  * Click the title screen to enter fullscreen and begin playback

